Settings.TextBooks.Dictionary.Hint=This is where you can change what speech synthesisers get wrong. You can correct the pronunciation of names and places, fix wrong stress, and much more — just use your imagination. The best part is that you can do this separately by language and by voice, because different synthesisers make different mistakes in the same language.
